# Decision 0010: A project Pages site

The game is published as a GitHub project Pages site at `{{ pages_url }}`, beneath the
repository's name. The record will explain why the deployment builds with a base path
read from the workflow event rather than written into the repository, why no custom
domain is configured at the start, and what a game that later wants one would change.
